<ul>
<li><strong>TechCards</strong> uses colorful technology logos from <code>/public/images/technology-logos/</code></li>
<li><strong>DetailIconCards</strong> uses monochrome feature icons mapped in component code</li>
<li><strong>DocsList</strong> uses built-in themes for simple navigation</li>
<li>Always test icons in the target component before using</li>
<li>Choose the right component based on your use case, not just the icon availability</li>
